.TH SPPDOCS-CI-INIT 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPPDocs CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
sppdocs:ci:init \- Scaffold CI/CD automation pipelines and local Git commit hooks for SPPDocs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php sppdocs:ci:init
[\fB\-\-project=\fIproject-id\fR]
[\fB\-\-platform=\fIgithub|gitlab|local\fR]
[\fB\-\-url=\fIwebhook-url\fR]
[\fB\-\-secret=\fIsecret-token\fR]
[\fB\-\-output=\fIcustom-path\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsppdocs:ci:init\fR configures turnkey continuous integration pipelines for repositories connected to an SPPDocs workspace. It generates GitHub Actions workflows, GitLab CI definitions, or local Git post-commit hooks that synchronize pushes, auto-resolve issues via commit messages (e.g., "Fixes #12"), and log billable developer hours.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project=\fIproject-id\fR
Target documentation project identifier (defaults to \fIdemo-app\fR).
.TP
\fB\-\-platform=\fIgithub|gitlab|local\fR
Target CI/CD ecosystem (defaults to \fIgithub\fR).
.TP
\fB\-\-url=\fIwebhook-url\fR
Target webhook endpoint for dispatching git events.
.TP
\fB\-\-secret=\fIsecret-token\fR
HMAC SHA-256 signature token for authenticating webhook requests.
.TP
\fB\-\-output=\fIcustom-path\fR
Custom destination file path.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Compiles platform-specific CI definitions, ensures target directories exist, writes configuration files with appropriate permissions, and restricts execution to CLI SAPI environments.
